      "side": 1,
      "message": "A nice to have thing: There is a similar API in R, https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/ApplicationExitInfo?hl\u003den#getTraceInputStream(), it only returns the ANR traces now. Maybe we could hook them up later to return the tombstone traces as well.",
