      "writtenOn": "2021-02-05T22:22:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That was my original plan, but I\u0027m not sure we can provide all of the fields that ApplicationExitInfo provides (getImportance and getProcessStateSummary primarily, and getPss/getRss as well, although it looks like the javadoc for those allows us to return 0 for those.)\n\nThe semantics of packageName in getHistoricalProcessExitReasons would be different as well: I don\u0027t think we can differentiate between packages in the same UID (we don\u0027t know the package name!).\n\nGiven that, do you think we should implement this in ApplicationExitInfo?",
      "parentUuid": "147df8d0_5ae25199",
      "revId": "1682c4a26b99bd6c0667fa3647836b7290bb2974",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
